Package: sysmon
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: small system monitoring daemon
 sysmond samples cpu, memory, load, disks and plugin metrics, keeps a
 short history in memory and serves it over a unix socket, a Prometheus
 endpoint and a small web dashboard. sysmonctl is its client.
